TI  - THE MGLUR2/3 ANTAGONIST ENHANCES THE BEHAVIORAL AND CELLULAR ANTIDEPRESSANT-LIKE EFFECTS OF PSILOCYBIN AND SCOPOLAMINE
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF NEUROPSYCHOPHARMACOLOGY
M3  - Meeting Abstract
